        "title": "HC Caveat Details API",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "description": "API provides complete history of the caveat from a High court establishment matching the Caveat Code. Input for this API is Establishment Code, Caveat Code and other details. Every Caveat has a unique 15 digit Caveat Code within the establishment. This unique code can be retrieved by accessing Caveat using Caveat Search by party name or Caveat Registration Number API."
